* James Oldfield, Shawn Im, Sharon Li, Mihalis Nicolaou, Ioannis Patras, Grigorios Chrysos, **[Towards Interpretability Without Sacrifice: Faithful Dense Layer Decomposition with Mixture of Decoders](https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.21364)**, NeurIPS 2025.
* Simone Ricci, Niccolò Biondi, Federico Pernici, Ioannis Patras, Alberto Del Bimbo, **[λ-Orthogonality Regularization for Compatible Representation Learning](https://arxiv.org/abs/2509.16664)**, NeurIPS 2025.
